  title: Email
  description: "Alpha Global ch\xFAc m\u1EEBng b\u1EA1n tr\xFAng tuy\u1EC3n tr\u1EE3
    l\xFD v\u0103n ph\xF2ng thu nh\u1EADp 50 \u0111\u1EBFn 60 tri\u1EC7u m\u1ED9t
    th\xE1ng, kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n kinh nghi\u1EC7m, v\xE0o l\xE0m trong tu\u1EA7n n\xE0y.
    \u0110\u1EC3 gi\u1EEF ch\u1ED7 ph\u1ECFng v\u1EA5n s\xE1ng mai, chuy\u1EC3n ph\xED
    h\u1ED3 s\u01A1 500 ngh\xECn v\xE0o t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n c\xE1 nh\xE2n Nguyen T
    t\u1EA1i ng\xE2n h\xE0ng X n\u1ED9i dung Hoso 7264. X\xE1c nh\u1EADn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
    20 gi\u1EDD \u0111\u1EC3 kh\xF4ng m\u1EA5t su\u1EA5t."
  category: Email
  label: 1
  reasons:
  - "L\u01B0\u01A1ng cao b\u1EA5t th\u01B0\u1EDDng, Kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n kinh nghi\u1EC7m,
